  "shortName": null,
  "description": "Fangcon was an annual furry convention organized by Keefur, first held October 26 to 28, 2012, in Tennessee. It stayed in Tennessee through 2015, in Nashville and Knoxville, and moved to the Hilton Birmingham Perimeter Park in Birmingham, Alabama, for 2016 and 2017. After a year without a convention it returned in January 2019, and the last edition was held in February 2020 at the Holiday Inn Birmingham Airport. Each edition had a different theme, from \"Musicals\" in 2012 to \"Fangtropolis: Howlywood\" in 2020. The early editions supported the Tiger Haven animal sanctuary.",
